+  metadata: { ... },
+  metrics: evaluations,
+  passed: thresholdEvaluation.passed,
+  thresholds: thresholdEvaluation.thresholds
+};
+```
+
+When `thresholds` is undefined (or empty), `passed` should be `true` and `thresholds` should be an empty array (backward compatible).
